WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.860
Have you ever wondered about the secret&nbsp;
desire of SCP-085, Hand Drawn Cassy?

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:09.600
Foundation researchers snapped a&nbsp;
photo of SCP-085 using SCP-978,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.680
the Desire Camera, while she was tinkering&nbsp;
with a drawn car, and this was the result:

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.020
"Engaged in the same activity; however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.200
the photograph depicts 085 as&nbsp;
a three-dimensional human."

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.660
It seems as if all Cassy really wants is&nbsp;
to be an ordinary girl. A simple wish,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.760
that will sadly never come true.

